T("Who was missing what their role needs: flask, food, role elixir, weapon oil / stone.", "Wem fehlte, was seine Rolle braucht: Fläschchen, Essen, Rollen-Elixier, Waffenöl / -stein.", "Qui manquait de ce dont son rôle a besoin : flacon, nourriture, élixir de rôle, huile / pierre d'arme.", "A quién le faltaba lo que su rol necesita: frasco, comida, elixir del rol, aceite / piedra de arma.", "A chi mancava ciò che serve al suo ruolo: fiala, cibo, elisir del ruolo, olio / pietra per l'arma.", "Quem estava sem o que a função precisa: frasco, comida, elixir da função, óleo / pedra de arma.", "Кому не хватало нужного для роли: настой, еда, эликсир роли, масло / камень для оружия.", "谁缺了职责所需：合剂、食物、职责药剂、武器油 / 磨刀石。", "역할에 필요한 것이 빠진 사람: 영약, 음식, 역할 비약, 무기 오일 / 숫돌.")
